ETF Inflows &amp; Policy Boosts
Bitcoin edged up ~1% to ~$119,200 early Monday as U.S. regulatory clarity and the GENIUS Act fuel institutional momentum. Altcoins also rallied—Ether +3.5%, XRP +3.1%, Solana +6.3%, Dogecoin +8.7%—on the same legislative tailwind  .
